sequenceDiagram
    participant B as executingBroker:<br/>«FinancialInstitution»<br/>ExecutingBroker
    participant C as centralMatchingUtility:<br/>«System»<br/>CentralMatchingUtility
    participant F as institutionalInvestor:<br/>«FinancialInstitution»<br/>InstitutionalInvestor
    B->>+C: SecuritiesTradeConfirmation
    deactivate C
    C->>+F: SecuritiesTradeConfirmation
    deactivate F
    F->>+C: SecuritiesTradeConfirmationResponse
    deactivate C
    C->>+B: SecuritiesTradeConfirmationStatusAdvice
    deactivate B
    Note over B,F: The flow may also be carried out between<br/>Underwriter and Issuer Agent
